stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Upcoming

    Upcoming --> Pickable : Before kickoff
    Pickable --> Picked : User submits valid pick
    Pickable --> Locked : Kickoff reached
    Picked --> Locked : Kickoff reached

    Locked --> Settling : Game becomes final
    Settling --> Won : Pick covers spread
    Settling --> Lost : Pick does not cover
    Settling --> Push : Spread results in tie

    Won --> [*]
    Lost --> [*]
    Push --> [*]

    note right of Picked
        Pick stores:
        - user
        - game
        - picked team
        - locked GameLine
        - submitted_at
    end note

    note right of Settling
        Settlement is idempotent.
        Running settlement twice
        produces the same result.
    end note